tsrs-only visibility patch (no _patches/typescript counterpart): Go shim accessors that internal/rewriter and
internal/fixable use reach unexported typescript-go members, which tsrs keeps private.

- ls.LanguageService_converters (extra-shim): LanguageService::converters becomes `pub`.
- change.Tracker_getNonformattedText (extra-shim): Tracker::get_nonformatted_text becomes `pub`.

